   "x": -1220,
   "y": -1300,
   "text": "Moved to HalalGoes Restaurant — Settings: https://claude.ai/artifact/VkGvVQsxmCHp8CGnCLVKga\n\nSections moved: Settings (one section at a time), Orders right now (pause, closed, off and offline), Halal certification states, Account states, Editing the business profile, Halal certificate upload, After sending: review, Other documents, This device, What's new, and the settings reflow (400% zoom) artboards.\n\nStill here: the orders strip, payouts at launch, Stripe setup, keyboard focus, the payouts reflow (400% zoom) artboards and the Later version page."
